<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n88576" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσανα-παύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cause to rest also</i> or <i>beside</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν δύναμιν ἐπὶ τρεῖς ἡμέρας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					4.73.3
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν χεῖρα τῇ γαστρί τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					20.2.1
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Med.
			 or 
				Pass.
			, <i>sleep beside</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῇ γυναικί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nicostr.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Stob.
				4.23.65
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>rest by leaning upon</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δένδροις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					16.4.10
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς θυρεοῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Sull.</u>
					28
				</span></i>
			; <i>rest upon</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				1.7
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				100
			</span></i>; of a shipwrecked sailor, <i>cling to</i> a plank,
			Favorin.in <i><span class="en">
				<u>PVat.</u>
				11.23.36
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> of words in a
			sentence, <i>to be otiose</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Dem.</u>
				40
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>rely on</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τεχνίῳ, τέχνῃ</span>,
				<i><span class="en">
				M.Ant.
				4.31
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>M.</u>
				11.178
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινι</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				6.14.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Marcellin.
				<u>Puls.</u>
				227
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b>
			<i>find relief in the society of</i>, [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φίλῳ</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>Epict.</u>
				3.13.2
			</span></i>; also, <i>find rest in</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῇ σοφίᾳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Wi.</u>
					8.16
				</span></i>
			.</div>
